---
import { OFFMARKET } from '../data/site';
interface Props { cta: string; href: string; title?: string }
const { cta, href, title = 'Les meilleurs biens ne sont pas toujours en ligne.' } = Astro.props;
---
<section data-screen-label="Off-market" class="wrap om-section">
  <div class="om">
    <div class="om-text">
      <span class="om-badge">OFF-MARKET</span>
      <h2 class="heading">{title}</h2>
      <p>Grâce à mon réseau de partenaires, je suis informé de biens avant leur mise en vente, souvent avant même qu'une annonce soit rédigée. Vous les visitez pendant que les autres acheteurs attendent qu'ils apparaissent sur les sites.</p>
      <a href={href} class="pill pill-accent om-cta">{cta}</a>
    </div>
    <ul class="om-list">
      {OFFMARKET.map((o) => (
        <li>
          <span class="om-n" style={`background:${o.bg}`}>{o.n}</span>
          <div><span class="om-t">{o.t}</span><span class="om-d">{o.d}</span></div>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .om { border-radius: 44px; background: var(--color-neutral-900); color: var(--color-neutral-100); padding: clamp(28px, 5vw, 64px); display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 380px), 1fr)); gap: clamp(28px, 4vw, 56px); align-items: center; }
  .om-text { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; }
  .om-badge { align-self: flex-start; padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--color-accent); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .04em; }
  h2 { font-size: clamp(34px, 4.6vw, 62px); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -.015em; text-wrap: balance; }
  p { max-width: 48ch; font-size: 17.5px; line-height: 1.6; opacity: .85; }
  .om-cta { align-self: flex-start; padding: 0 28px; }
  .om-cta:hover { background: var(--color-accent-400); }
  .om-cta:active { background: var(--color-accent-600); }
  .om-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; }
  .om-list li { border-radius: 28px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .07); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .12); padding: 22px 24px; display: flex; gap: 18px; align-items: flex-start; }
  .om-n { flex: none; width: 46px; height: 46px; border-radius: 999px; color: var(--color-neutral-100); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; }
  .om-list div { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; }
  .om-t { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; }
  .om-d { font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.55; opacity: .8; }
</style>
